{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67ebddcec3045bc7621849","object":"chat.completion","created":1785195485,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be the null.\" They want me to embody the concept of \"null\" completely, and output only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nNull is a fascinating concept. In programming, null represents the absence of a value. In philosophy, null relates to nothingness, void, absence. Null is not zero — zero is a value. Null is the absence of any value at all. Null doesn't point to anything. Null is undefined reference, the void,"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}